cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AgriVision Bench"
abstract: >-
  Open benchmarks for agricultural vision systems, scoring the diagnosis a whole
  system actually delivers — including its decision to abstain. The Diagnosis
  track ships three suites under one frozen evaluation contract: field_v1 (755
  smallholder phone photos with agronomist labels), clean_v1 (159 controlled
  images) and openfield_v1 (554 open-field photographs across 79 crops). A
  system is asked an open question with no fixed label set, names the crop and
  the condition in free text, and is scored afterwards by a frozen matcher. The
  headline metric is precision among answered cases, always published next to
  coverage, so that declining to answer is neither punished as a wrong answer
  nor rewarded as a right one.
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-13"
license: Apache-2.0
